            "heading_size": "h2",
            "rich_text_cstm": "<p>One of the biggest benefits of variable image label printing is its ability to create personalized, unique labels that can improve the overall consumer experience. By including customized details, these labels can create a sense of exclusivity and increase consumer engagement.</p><p>Some specific ways that variable image label printing can boost the consumer experience include:</p>"
