          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Reflecting a consumer’s unique taste.",
            "content": "<p>Customized and personalized labels make it easy to reflect a consumer’s individual preferences. This can mean personalizing everything from fonts, designs, and colors to specific graphics and messaging.</p>",
