            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Illustrating a consumer’s values.",
            "content": "<p>Consumers like to purchase brands that say something about their values and who they are as a person. Variable image printing can create labels that promote brand initiatives such as “for every product bought, we’ll donate to charity.” Labels like this can attract consumers looking to make “good” purchases that align with their values.</p>",
