            "content": "<p>Because variable image printing can be used to create personalized, custom products, they create a sense of exclusivity and security. For example, event organizers can use variable label printing to make personalized invitations, tickets, or badges to deliver a tailored experience and make it simpler to identify attendees.</p>",
